{"Title":"An Act validating the results of the annual election held in the town of Whitman on May 20, 2023","BillNumber":"S2516","DocketNumber":"SD2879","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-11-29T15:11:15.38"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MDB0","Name":"Michael D. Brady","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MDB0","ResponseDate":"2023-11-29T15:11:15.3966667"},{"Id":"AMS2","Name":"Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMS2","ResponseDate":"2023-11-30T11:42:30.26"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2516/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brady, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2516) of Michael D. Brady and Alyson M. Sullivan-Almeida (by vote of the town) for legislation to validate the results of the annual election held in the town of Whitman on May 20, 2023.  Election Laws.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, all acts and proceedings taken by the town of Whitman at the annual town election held on May 20, 2023 and all actions taken pursuant thereto are hereby ratified, validated and confirmed, notwithstanding any failure to include the form of the proposition two and one-half, so-called, debt exclusion question in the posted warrants for said election.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[{"Description":"S2516 -- Whitman","DownloadUrl":"http://malegislature.gov/api/DownloadReport?attachmentId=17398&title=S2516%20--%20Whitman"}],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J15","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J15"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}